{"5023460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skatebug", "steam_appid": 5023460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skatebug is a crunchy, dynamic, fingermashing skater game from times long gone. Throw away your controller, because skatebug uses a unique key-based trick system. Grind tricks, memorise combos, move faster and faster until you become the nastiest skater in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique key-based trick system where tricks take real practice to land and even more to perfect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Bug, an unemployed skater who's trying to kill time between now and her next job. Whenever that comes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find gaps, hidden collectables and spraycans in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple areas, districts and secret spots of New Milton Keynes via its unique (and very underfunded) train system!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skatebug is a crunchy, dynamic, fingermashing skater game from times long gone. Throw away your controller, because skatebug uses a unique key-based trick system. Grind tricks, memorise combos, move faster and faster until you become the nastiest skater in the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique key-based trick system where tricks take real practice to land and even more to perfect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Bug, an unemployed skater who's trying to kill time between now and her next job. Whenever that comes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find gaps, hidden collectables and spraycans in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple areas, districts and secret spots of New Milton Keyne